      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w19.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「当場は、物語を終えた者たちが、続きを生きるための場所である」何度読んでも、いい一行だと思う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "額を外した壁を見て、ノノさんが「あら」と言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣に、もう一つ、四角い日焼け跡。同じ大きさだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……ここには昔、何かが並んで掛かっていたらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w19.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "記録室の司書さんに聞いた。台帳を、三往復してくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "首を振って、「記録に、ありません。台帳にも」それから、少しだけ声を落として言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「台帳に無いものが、この街には、いくつかあるんです」「あなたの控えと。この跡と」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……え。耳が、ぴくっと立つ。台帳に無いもの、私も、その一つ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "深追いは、今週はしない。決勝前だ。それでも事務員の癖で、跡の寸法だけ測って控えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "縦横、趣意書とぴったり同じ。……几帳面、直らない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "掛け直した額の隣の空白は、何かを待つ顔をしていた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "準備は、順調だった。特訓は仕上げ、装備は磨かれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "まかないは、験担ぎの献立表を組み始めていた。赤線は三本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "残る条文は、出口廃止と名入れ販売。それと——条文の無い、六つ目。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "掲示板に、所有者グランプリの告知が出た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会場の欄を読んで、受付が、すっと静まる。「本日の会場: 第十七号室」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……会場が、部屋?部屋の中で、試合をするらしい。変な話だ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜、帰りぎわに振り返った。正面玄関の灯りの下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰かが立って、日焼け跡をじっと見上げていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w19.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "背中しか、見えなかった。声は、かけなかった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w19.node.end.001",
